{"id":"H3437","lemma":"יָשׁוּב","transliteration":"yashuv","sayIt":"ya-shuv","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jashub","meaning":"A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Ezr.10.29\n§ Jashub = \"he will return\"\n1) the 3rd son of Issachar and founder of the family of Jashubites\n2) one of the sons of Bani who had to put away a foreign wife in the time of Ezra","glosses":["jashub"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-26","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Jashub","kjv":"Of Jashub"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jashub","kjv":"Jashub"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jashub","kjv":"Jashub"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 26:24","note":"of Jashub, the family of the Jashubites; of Shimron, the family of the Shimronites.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:1","note":"Of the sons of Issachar: Tola, and Puah, Jashub, and Shimron, four.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 10:29","note":"Of the sons of Bani: Meshullam, Malluch, and Adaiah, Jashub, and Sheal, Jeremoth.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3485","lemma":"יִשָּׂשכָר","transliteration":"yissaskhar","gloss":"Issachar"},{"id":"H8439","lemma":"תּוֹלָע","transliteration":"tola","gloss":"Tola"},{"id":"H6312","lemma":"פּוּאָה","transliteration":"puah","gloss":"Puah"},{"id":"H8110","lemma":"שִׁמְרוֹן","transliteration":"shimron","gloss":"Shimron"},{"id":"H3102","lemma":"יוֹב","transliteration":"yov","gloss":"Yob"},{"id":"H3432","lemma":"יָשֻׁבִי","transliteration":"yashuvi","gloss":"Jashubite"},{"id":"H6324","lemma":"פּוּנִי","transliteration":"puni","gloss":"Punite"},{"id":"H8117","lemma":"שִׁמְרֹנִי","transliteration":"shimroni","gloss":"Shimronite"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3437H","gloss":"Jashub","relation":"H3437H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}